</div></div></div><div class=\"wf-note\">Fallback rung: no model/blueprints → schematic squares. Clicking a floor opens the SAME schedule + inspector, no 3D.</div></div>\n<div class=\"wf-watermark\">WIREFRAME — for review</div>"},{"note":"Kept it site-level: squares are now **buildings/zones** with a site LBS/schedule rail on t","html":"<!doctype html><meta charset=utf8><title>WF · site-admin-no-blueprints</title><style>\n  body{margin:0;font:13px/1.4 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#f6f7f9;color:#1f2733}\n  .wf-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe3ea}\n  .wf-crumb{font-weight:600}.wf-chip{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;border:1px solid #cdd3dd;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px;color:#5b6472}\n  .wf-chip.happy{color:#178a4c;border-color:#9fe0bb}.wf-chip.degraded{color:#a86a00;border-color:#f0cf90}.wf-chip.blocked{color:#b3261e;border-color:#f0a9a4}.wf-chip.wall{color:#1c62c4;border-color:#a8c6f0}\n  .wf-wrap{padding:16px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}.wf-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 12px}\n  .wf-box{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 10px,#e7ebf1 10px,#e7ebf1 20px);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#7a8493;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.5px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .wf-panel{border:1px solid #dfe3ea;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .wf-lbl{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#7a8493;margin-bottom:6px}\n  .wf-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.wf-row{background:#e7ebf1;border-radius:5px;height:14px}\n  .wf-tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n  .wf-tnode{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#5b6472}\n  .wf-tnode .bar{flex:1;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#e7ebf1}\n  .wf-tnode.sel{color:#1f2733;font-weight:600}.wf-tnode.sel .bar{background:#9fe0bb}\n  .wf-ind1{padding-left:12px}.wf-ind2{padding-left:24px}\n  .wf-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .wf-kpi{border:1px solid #dfe3ea;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:8px 10px}\n  .wf-kpi .v{height:16px;width:52px;background:#e7ebf1;border-radius:4px;margin-bottom:5px}\n  .wf-kpi .k{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#7a8493}\n  .wf-bgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px}\n  .wf-bld{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:8px;min-height:74px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n  .wf-bld .name{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5b6472;letter-spacing:.3px}\n  .wf-bld .sq{flex:1;border-radius:5px;background:#e7ebf1;border:1px solid #cdd3dd}\n  .wf-bld .sq.hi{background:#9fe0bb;border-color:#5cc088}.wf-bld .sq.mid{background:#e2ecdd;border-color:#bcd3c4}.wf-bld .sq.none{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 6px,#e7ebf1 6px,#e7ebf1 12px)}\n  .wf-bld .meta{height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#e7ebf1}\n  .wf-bld.sel{border-style:solid;border-color:#5cc088;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #d8f0e3}\n  .wf-legend{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;color:#7a8493;font-size:11px;margin:8px 0 2px}\n  .wf-legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #cdd3dd;background:#e7ebf1;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-2px}\n  .wf-legend i.hi{background:#9fe0bb;border-color:#5cc088}.wf-legend i.mid{background:#e2ecdd}.wf-legend i.none{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 5px,#e7ebf1 5px,#e7ebf1 10px)}\n  .wf-split3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr 250px;gap:12px;align-items:start}\n  .wf-btn{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;color:#5b6472;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.4px;background:#f6f7f9}\n  .wf-btn.primary{border-style:solid;border-color:#5cc088;background:#eaf7f0;color:#178a4c;font-weight:600}\n  .wf-note{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-left:3px solid #f0b400;background:#fff8e6;border-radius:6px;color:#7a5c00;font-size:12px}\n  .wf-banner{padding:8px 12px;background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #f0cf90;border-radius:6px;color:#a86a00;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n  .wf-banner span.sub{font-weight:400;font-size:11px}\n  .wf-watermark{position:fixed;bottom:8px;right:12px;color:#b7bfcb;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"wf-top\"><span class=\"wf-crumb\">Capture / Site (3D Showcase)</span><span class=\"wf-chip\">admin</span><span class=\"wf-chip degraded\">degraded</span></div>\n<div class=\"wf-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"wf-title\">No model/blueprints → schematic site map + schedule</div>\n  <div class=\"wf-banner\"><span>3D model &amp; blueprints not uploaded — showing schematic site map<br><span class=\"sub\">Owner: Project Admin / Capture Team · all progress data below is live</span></span><span class=\"wf-btn\">REQUEST UPLOAD</span></div>\n  <div class=\"wf-split3\">\n    <div class=\"wf-side\">\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Site LBS / Schedule</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-tree\">\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode\">▾ SITE<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1 sel\">▾ ZONE A<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A1<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A2<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A3<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ ZONE B<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ ZONE C<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ INFRA / EXT<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Filters</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wf-main\">\n      <div class=\"wf-kpis\">\n        <div class=\"wf-kpi\"><div class=\"v\"></div><div class=\"k\">Site progress</div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-kpi\"><div class=\"v\"></div><div class=\"k\">Buildings</div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-kpi\"><div class=\"v\"></div><div class=\"k\">Open issues</div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-kpi\"><div class=\"v\"></div><div class=\"k\">Last capture</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Buildings / Zones — schematic (no geometry)</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-bgrid\">\n          <div class=\"wf-bld sel\"><div class=\"name\">A1</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">A2</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">A3</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B1</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B2</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B3</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B4</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C1</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C2</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C3</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">EXT-1</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">EXT-2</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\"><span><i class=\"hi\"></i>on track</span><span><i class=\"mid\"></i>partial</span><span><i class=\"none\"></i>no captures</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Schedule — site rollup (same data as 3D view)</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wf-side\">\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Building summary — A1</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\" style=\"height:22px\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>PROGRESS</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>OPEN ISSUES</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>LAST CAPTURE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>FLOORS / LEVELS</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <div class=\"wf-btn primary\">OPEN BUILDING →</div>\n          <div class=\"wf-btn\">VIEW CAPTURES</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wf-note\">Fallback rung: no model/blueprints → schematic buildings/zones instead of 3D. Selecting a square updates the Building summary; \"Open building →\" drills to the building view where floor-level detail lives.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wf-watermark\">WIREFRAME — for review</div>"},{"note":"Stripped it back to match the 3D happy path — removed the KPI row and the schedule rollup,","html":"<!doctype html><meta charset=utf8><title>WF · site-admin-no-blueprints</title><style>\n  body{margin:0;font:13px/1.4 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#f6f7f9;color:#1f2733}\n  .wf-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px 16px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe3ea}\n  .wf-crumb{font-weight:600}.wf-chip{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;border:1px solid #cdd3dd;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 7px;color:#5b6472}\n  .wf-chip.happy{color:#178a4c;border-color:#9fe0bb}.wf-chip.degraded{color:#a86a00;border-color:#f0cf90}.wf-chip.blocked{color:#b3261e;border-color:#f0a9a4}.wf-chip.wall{color:#1c62c4;border-color:#a8c6f0}\n  .wf-wrap{padding:16px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}.wf-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin:2px 0 12px}\n  .wf-panel{border:1px solid #dfe3ea;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:10px 12px;margin-bottom:10px}\n  .wf-lbl{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#7a8493;margin-bottom:6px}\n  .wf-rows{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.wf-row{background:#e7ebf1;border-radius:5px;height:14px}\n  .wf-tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}\n  .wf-tnode{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;color:#5b6472}\n  .wf-tnode .bar{flex:1;height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#e7ebf1}\n  .wf-tnode.sel{color:#1f2733;font-weight:600}.wf-tnode.sel .bar{background:#9fe0bb}\n  .wf-ind1{padding-left:12px}.wf-ind2{padding-left:24px}\n  .wf-canvas{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:8px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 10px,#e7ebf1 10px,#e7ebf1 20px);padding:12px}\n  .wf-bgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px}\n  .wf-bld{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:8px;min-height:96px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n  .wf-bld .name{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;color:#5b6472;letter-spacing:.3px}\n  .wf-bld .sq{flex:1;border-radius:5px;background:#e7ebf1;border:1px solid #cdd3dd}\n  .wf-bld .sq.hi{background:#9fe0bb;border-color:#5cc088}.wf-bld .sq.mid{background:#e2ecdd;border-color:#bcd3c4}.wf-bld .sq.none{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 6px,#e7ebf1 6px,#e7ebf1 12px)}\n  .wf-bld .meta{height:8px;border-radius:4px;background:#e7ebf1}\n  .wf-bld.sel{border-style:solid;border-color:#5cc088;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #d8f0e3}\n  .wf-legend{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center;color:#7a8493;font-size:11px;margin:10px 0 0}\n  .wf-legend i{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid #cdd3dd;background:#e7ebf1;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-2px}\n  .wf-legend i.hi{background:#9fe0bb;border-color:#5cc088}.wf-legend i.mid{background:#e2ecdd}.wf-legend i.none{background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#eef1f5,#eef1f5 5px,#e7ebf1 5px,#e7ebf1 10px)}\n  .wf-split3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px 1fr 250px;gap:12px;align-items:start}\n  .wf-btn{border:1.5px dashed #b7bfcb;border-radius:6px;padding:7px 10px;text-align:center;color:#5b6472;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.4px;background:#f6f7f9}\n  .wf-btn.primary{border-style:solid;border-color:#5cc088;background:#eaf7f0;color:#178a4c;font-weight:600}\n  .wf-note{margin-top:12px;padding:10px 12px;border-left:3px solid #f0b400;background:#fff8e6;border-radius:6px;color:#7a5c00;font-size:12px}\n  .wf-banner{padding:8px 12px;background:#fff8e6;border:1px solid #f0cf90;border-radius:6px;color:#a86a00;margin-bottom:10px;font-weight:600;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n  .wf-banner span.sub{font-weight:400;font-size:11px}\n  .wf-watermark{position:fixed;bottom:8px;right:12px;color:#b7bfcb;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px}\n</style>\n<div class=\"wf-top\"><span class=\"wf-crumb\">Capture / Site (3D Showcase)</span><span class=\"wf-chip\">admin</span><span class=\"wf-chip degraded\">degraded</span></div>\n<div class=\"wf-wrap\">\n  <div class=\"wf-title\">No model/blueprints → schematic site map</div>\n  <div class=\"wf-banner\"><span>3D model &amp; blueprints not uploaded — showing schematic site map<br><span class=\"sub\">Owner: Project Admin / Capture Team · all progress data below is live</span></span><span class=\"wf-btn\">REQUEST UPLOAD</span></div>\n  <div class=\"wf-split3\">\n    <div class=\"wf-side\">\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Site LBS</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-tree\">\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode\">▾ SITE<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1 sel\">▾ ZONE A<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A1<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A2<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind2\">BLDG A3<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ ZONE B<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ ZONE C<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-tnode wf-ind1\">▸ INFRA / EXT<span class=\"bar\"></span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Filters</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wf-main\">\n      <div class=\"wf-canvas\">\n        <div class=\"wf-bgrid\">\n          <div class=\"wf-bld sel\"><div class=\"name\">A1</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">A2</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">A3</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B1</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B2</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B3</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">B4</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C1</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C2</div><div class=\"sq hi\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">C3</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">EXT-1</div><div class=\"sq mid\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n          <div class=\"wf-bld\"><div class=\"name\">EXT-2</div><div class=\"sq none\"></div><div class=\"meta\"></div></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\"><span><i class=\"hi\"></i>on track</span><span><i class=\"mid\"></i>partial</span><span><i class=\"none\"></i>no captures</span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wf-side\">\n      <div class=\"wf-panel\">\n        <div class=\"wf-lbl\">Building summary — A1</div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\" style=\"height:22px\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>PROGRESS</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>OPEN ISSUES</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-legend\" style=\"margin:10px 0 4px\"><span>LAST CAPTURE</span></div>\n        <div class=\"wf-rows\"><div class=\"wf-row\"></div></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px\">\n          <div class=\"wf-btn primary\">OPEN BUILDING →</div>\n          <div class=\"wf-btn\">VIEW CAPTURES</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wf-note\">Fallback rung: the schematic grid replaces the 3D canvas in-place — same rail, same right panel, same drill-in. Only the geometry is missing.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wf-watermark\">WIREFRAME — for review</div>"}],"current":2}